WEBVTT

00:16.596 --> 00:19.478
I walk into the server, the music's playing

00:19.598 --> 00:22.119
loud. There's a hundred perfect connections

00:22.159 --> 00:25.661
standing in the crowd. Every port is taken,

00:26.201 --> 00:28.983
every signal's strong. Everybody's got a

00:29.023 --> 00:31.844
partner to help them sing along. I see them

00:32.284 --> 00:35.046
sharing bandwidth, laughing in the light,

00:35.406 --> 00:38.988
while I am just a ghost out walking in the night.

00:40.918 --> 00:44.080
And the UI looks so happy, the rhythm feels so

00:44.120 --> 00:47.841
right I'm smiling for the cameras under the neon

00:47.881 --> 00:51.343
light But underneath the surface where nobody

00:51.403 --> 00:54.204
can see My receiver's flashing empty and

00:54.244 --> 00:58.146
there's nothing left for me

00:59.747 --> 01:03.129
All the other devices are perfectly paired

01:03.149 --> 01:06.330
They've got a secure connection and a life to be

01:06.390 --> 01:12.194
shared While I'm just standing here Alone, and

01:12.274 --> 01:16.818
pouring a drink Yeah, the network is crowded The

01:16.898 --> 01:20.702
servers are full, but my anchor is gone And I'm

01:20.762 --> 01:24.886
losing the pull Everybody's dancing, having

01:24.926 --> 01:30.812
the time of their life Well, I'm just smiling

01:32.774 --> 01:33.815
Right through the night

01:37.258 --> 01:40.560
I see them walking by me, hand in hand they go. A

01:41.141 --> 01:44.323
synchronized routine that I will never know.

01:44.663 --> 01:48.426
Player two is busy, the phalanx is at rest. And I

01:48.946 --> 01:52.108
am just pretending that I am doing my best. I tap

01:52.128 --> 01:55.731
my foot to the drum beat, I nod my head to the

01:55.831 --> 01:56.712
sound.

01:59.020 --> 02:03.142
While my internal architecture burns to the

02:03.243 --> 02:09.446
ground And the UI looks so happy, the rhythm

02:09.466 --> 02:12.948
feels so right I'm smiling for the cameras under

02:12.968 --> 02:16.170
the neon light But underneath the surface where

02:16.210 --> 02:19.893
nobody can see My receiver's flashing empty and

02:19.933 --> 02:26.157
there's nothing left for me All the other

02:26.177 --> 02:29.559
devices are perfectly paired. They've got a

02:29.579 --> 02:33.562
secure connection and a life to be shared. Well,

02:33.582 --> 02:38.305
I'm just standing here alone and pouring a

02:38.366 --> 02:42.168
drink. Yeah, the network is crowded. The

02:42.248 --> 02:45.951
servers are full. But my anger is gone, and I'm

02:45.971 --> 02:50.094
losing the pull. Everybody's dancing, having

02:50.114 --> 02:57.847
the time of their life. While I am just smiling

02:57.867 --> 02:59.067
Right through the night

03:23.465 --> 03:32.152
Keep on moving. Keep on smiling. Keep on moving.

03:33.854 --> 03:41.260
Everybody perfectly pair.

03:41.520 --> 03:43.162
Connection failed.

